<title>CHINA: CM Shekou Port mandates loan - bankers.</title>
<headline>CM Shekou Port mandates loan - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Merchants Shekou Port Service Holdings Co Ltd has mandated Societe Generale Asia to arrange a US$15 million term loan facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility would have a maturity of three years.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
